It's quick and dirty, with an emphasis on the quick part...

(spoiler to follow)



































The two requirements are a pet, and a magic whistle.  Simply wait in the
doorway, and as soon as your pet picks up anything, blow the whistle.  Most
of the time the pet will be behind you or in the "safe spot" in the
store...often the pet will drop the item (out of surprise?) and you can
pick it up right away!  If you want to make sure the pet teleports outside
of the shop, just take a step back out of the shop before blowing the
whistle.  It's a LOT faster than training a pet with tripe!

